  "source_limits": [
    "At R03 offset 0, the first form has a low shoulder and long thin stem extending below the adjacent 384 baseline. Contrast the tall upper loop of b in R02 bh6f5. Provisionally retain native FIRST p/B over prior mask and SECOND b/P. This is a local nonblind source choice, not a generic b/p rule. The two blackened middle masks and uncertain segmentation remain unchanged.",
    "Four native-orientation rows retain their geometry and source spaces: the short upper-right DOPIS fragment, separate left-hand JEDU row and two long lower rows are serialized editorially, without proven cross-region narrative order. No missing opening verb or terminal sender supplied.",
    "Current selected replay: 105 slots/100 known letters/zero CH/five unknown masks, versus 105/99/zero CH/six previously. Only R03 offset 0 ?→p and removal of its unknown-glyph tag change source input. Five remaining masks keep unknown physical lengths; no new glyph value, key alias, CH or physical body count. The exclamation-like mark remains qualified; no written question selected.",
    "AO NEJDRYVE→CO NEJDRIVE changes A→C and Y→I only in language; PUSI→PUSY changes I→Y only in language. NES?SLNE→NESCISLNE proposes CI for one mask only in prose, without selecting two source bodies or fixing physical length. M?A ?P and both terminal masks remain unresolved; do not infer a named body part, diagnosis or sender from grammar. Native SECOND partial ?f5r3? remains comparison evidence, not a recovered current terminal word.",
    "Both native first/second original_wrapper/raw/strict_public_projection records, initial reconciliation, provenance and whole QA17 remain unchanged. FIRST 103 slots/99 known/four masks and SECOND 112/110/two masks retain their own native inputs. FIRST public strict projection omits exactly three private raw_path header paths; SECOND omits zero. No raw-field omission or metadata-only wrapper schema imported. Eight native rows/six inline hashes replayed; unavailable original raw/strict FILE bytes not reread.",
    "Whole QA17 retains one other-card frozen locator/span/mechanical defect on FIRST 315, zero strict-replay/source-tag/schema errors, two separate paired formal preflight timing exceptions and five global scope findings/one 316 finding. Per-card preflights and both-raw-before-own-decode barriers passed. Date supplement corrects four to six bounded reading entries, not six dates; ordinary date/place-like writing remains excluded and unverified.",
    "Both fresh anonymous GET200 originals match pinned hashes with no redirects/retries. Complete Picture/Address faces/all margins and fourteen enlarged Picture contexts viewed privately. No additional continuous cipher run identified in the visible Address frame, a bounded negative only. Same-root key/language-visible nonblind review; not external confirmation of 316. Eugen Antal reviewed 320/321 only. Other candidates, historical receipts and submitted register remain unchanged."
  ],
